    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Waking Dreamfield.</strong> You briefly let the waking world and your inner dreamspace overlap.</p><p><strong>Once per Soma Break</strong>, as a bonus action, you enter a waking dreamstate for 1 minute:</p><ul><li>You gain a +1 bonus to Soul and Presence check.</li><li>Once per round, when you make an Insight (Soul), Perception (Mind), or Faith (Soul) check, you may add +1d4 to the roll.</li></ul><p>Bad Eden engines may treat this state as heightened anomaly-awareness for the duration.</p>",
